@startuml
!theme plain
title 股價查詢流程 - Sequence Diagram
' Author: AuraTrade Team
' Version: 1.0
' Last Updated: 2026-01-29

actor User
participant "Web App" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "StockController" as Controller
participant "StockService" as Service
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache
participant "StockRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Stock API" as External

User -> Web: 查詢股票 2330
activate Web

Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/stocks/2330/price
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Gateway: 驗證 JWT Token
Gateway -> Gateway: Rate Limiting Check

Gateway -> Controller: 轉發請求
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 驗證參數

Controller -> Service: get_real_time_price("2330")
activate Service

' 檢查快取
Service -> Cache: get("stock_price:2330")
activate Cache

alt 快取命中
    Cache --> Service: 返回快取數據
    Service --> Controller: 返回股價
else 快取未命中
    Cache --> Service: null
    deactivate Cache
    
    ' 查詢資料庫
    Service -> Repo: find_by_code("2330")
    activate Repo
    
    Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM stocks\nWHERE stock_code = '2330'
    activate DB
    
    alt 資料存在
        DB --> Repo: 股票資料
        deactivate DB
        Repo --> Service: Stock 實體
        deactivate Repo
        
        ' 呼叫外部 API 取得即時價格
        Service -> External: GET /quote/2330
        activate External
        External --> Service: 即時股價數據
        deactivate External
        
        ' 更新快取
        Service -> Cache: set("stock_price:2330", data, ttl=60)
        activate Cache
        Cache --> Service: OK
        deactivate Cache
        
        Service --> Controller: 返回股價
    else 股票不存在
        DB --> Repo: null
        deactivate DB
        Repo --> Service: null
        deactivate Repo
        Service --> Controller: StockNotFoundError
    end
end

deactivate Service

alt 成功
    Controller --> Gateway: 200 OK + 股價數據
    Gateway --> Web: JSON Response
    Web --> User: 顯示股價
else 失敗
    Controller --> Gateway: 404 Not Found
    Gateway --> Web: Error Response
    Web --> User: 顯示錯誤訊息
end

deactivate Controller
deactivate Gateway
deactivate Web

note right of Service
  業務邏輯：
  1. 優先檢查快取
  2. 快取未命中查資料庫
  3. 呼叫外部 API
  4. 更新快取
end note

@enduml
